    objective: 'The objective of this project is to develop a real-time eggshell defect detection system based on deep learning techniques, specifically YOLOv8-CBAM and RT-DETR- Swin. The project aims to enhance safety monitoring by detecting eggshell defects using images captured through poultry inspection systems. By leveraging the capabilities of YOLOv8-CBAM for defect detection, RT-DETR-Swin for improved multi-defect tracking, and AR Visualization for enhanced localization, the system aims to automatically identify defects as they occur. The integration of CBAM will provide visual interpretability by highlighting regions in the image that influence the model\'s decisions. The goal is to create an efficient, automated solution for real-time eggshell defect detection, enabling rapid rejection to defects and enhancing quality',
