    title: 'Deep Learning-Based Retinal Disease Detection Using Optical Coherence Tomography Images',
    objective: 'We introduce a deep-learning framework for automated OCT classification across eight retinal conditions using 24,000 balanced images. After benchmarking three architectures—Triple-Branch (CNN+Transformer+LSTM with SVM), Pyramid Vision Transformer, and HybridSENet—we selected HybridSENet for its superior performance, combining ConvNeXt and ViT embeddings with Squeeze-Excitation gating. Deployed as a Flask web app with MySQL authentication and a MobileNetV2 relevance filter, the system enhances clinical trust via an explainability dashboard featuring Grad-CAM, Grad- CAM++, EigenCAM, attention maps, and LIME, bridging advanced AI with transparent ophthalmic decision support.',
